{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983290/extras/fae503a4104c19fe0936828d77f3df3b.avif?t=1760300741\" data-has-big width=1560 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of HeartFix Express contains the first level and a glimpse of the story we want to create for the full game. It includes a small level designed specifically for the demo to demonstrate the potential of using a train for puzzles and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full game aims to offer 4 larger levels with unique themes and environments, as well as a complete story. Note that everything is subject to change, but you can expect to see Berner and Nhej in the full game as well!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two ambitious workers at the controls of a locomotive, tasked with repairing a GIANT robot from the inside.\u00a0Using sophisticated tools and brainpower, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with your <strong>Train</strong>! (and maybe uncover an industry-level conspiracy\u2026)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a collective of 3 game developers, working full time on our game <strong>HeartFix Express</strong>. We all have first hand industry experience, but chose to go indie in the midst of the current crisis. <strong>HeartFix Express</strong> is our first game as <strong>Keur Collectif</strong>, and we hope it will enable us to make more games in the future !</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Choo Chooooo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983290/8942bea279aec48cbb021d05d1fedd141baf96c2.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983290?t=1760300741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983290?t=1760300741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983290/3840cebc598438384108185c906a59b190c1fa71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760300741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983290/3840cebc598438384108185c906a59b190c1fa71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760300741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983290/extras/fae503a4104c19fe0936828d77f3df3b.avif?t=1760300741\" data-has-big width=1560 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of HeartFix Express contains the first level and a glimpse of the story we want to create for the full game. It includes a small level designed specifically for the demo to demonstrate the potential of using a train for puzzles and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full game aims to offer 4 larger levels with unique themes and environments, as well as a complete story. Note that everything is subject to change, but you can expect to see Berner and Nhej in the full game as well!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two ambitious workers at the controls of a locomotive, tasked with repairing a GIANT robot from the inside.\u00a0Using sophisticated tools and brainpower, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with your <strong>Train</strong>! (and maybe uncover an industry-level conspiracy\u2026)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 